msgid "You agree to comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and third party rights (including without limitation laws regarding the import or export of data or software, privacy, copyright, and local laws). You will not use the APIs to encourage or promote illegal activity or violation of third party rights. You will not violate any other terms of service with {platform_name}. You will only access (or attempt to access) an API by the means described in the documentation of that API. You will not misrepresent or mask either your identity or Your Application's identity when using the APIs."
